<title>USA: White House noncommittal on budget prospects.</title>
<headline>White House noncommittal on budget prospects.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The White House Wednesday refused to give odds on chances for a budget agreement with Congress before the weekend.</p>
<p>&quot;I expect hard work on that subject over the next several days. I'm not going to predict the outcome,&quot; White House spokesman Mike McCurry told reporters.</p>
</text>
